<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In Bridging Perception and Planning: Towards End-to-End Planningfor Signal Temporal Logic Tasks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
